WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.150
Check yourself with two questions.

2
00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:05.913
First: why does sequel P R D oh
one's cutover deny connect sequel

3
00:00:05.913 --> 00:00:10.025
to the Contoso payroll users group,
instead of disabling the login?

4
00:00:10.025 --> 00:00:11.024
The answer is a.

5
00:00:11.024 --> 00:00:14.187
Alter login disable can't
deny a Windows group:

6
00:00:14.187 --> 00:00:16.850
it returns error fifteen one fifty-one.

7
00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:18.863
A server-permission deny can.

8
00:00:18.863 --> 00:00:22.450
Second: a legacy login has
been disabled at cutover.

9
00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:23.800
When can it be dropped?

10
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:27.800
The answer is b: after thirty days'
observation, when the audit record,

11
00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:32.300
with failed logins for the disabled
login, shows nothing still depends on it.

12
00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:36.650
The module page has two more questions,
each linked to the section that answers it.
